msgctxt "ttpres/string/128"
msgid "千千静听"
msgstr "TTPlayer"

#. Preserve separators, file patterns and format placeholders.
msgctxt "ttpres/string/129"
msgid "    一个集播放、音效、转换、歌词等多种功能于一身的专业音频播放软件。\n\n    拥有自主研发的全新音频引擎，支持DirectSound、内核音频流(Kernel Streaming)和ASIO音频流输出、AddIn插件扩展技术，具有资源占用低、运行效率高、扩展能力强等优点。\n\n    支持MP3/mp3PRO、AAC/AAC+、M4A/MP4、WMA、APE、MPC、OGG、WAVE、CD、FLAC、RM、TTA、AIFF、AU等音频格式以及多种MOD和MIDI音乐，支持CUE音轨索引文件，支持所有格式到WAVE、MP3、APE、WMA等格式的转换，通过基于COM接口的AddIn插件可以支持更多格式的播放和转换。\n\n    支持采样频率转换(SSRC)和多种比特输出方式，支持回放增益，支持10波段均衡器、多级杜比环绕、淡入淡出音效，兼容并可同时激活多个Winamp2的音效插件。\n\n    支持ID3v1/v2、WMA、RM、APE和Vorbis标签，支持批量修改标签和以标签重命名文件。\n\n    支持同步歌词滚动显示和拖动定位播放，并且支持在线歌词搜索和歌词编辑功能。\n\n    支持多播放列表和音频文件搜索，支持多种视觉效果，采用XML格式的ZIP压缩的皮肤，同时具有磁性窗口、半透明/淡入淡出窗口、窗口阴影、任务栏图标、自定义快捷键、信息滚动、菜单功能提示等功能。\n\n    真正免费且无需注册，也不存在任何功能或时间限制。"
msgstr "    TTPlayer is a professional audio player featuring playback of music, sound effects, format conversion, lyrics display, etc.\n\n    TTPlayer has independently developed a new audio engine which supports DirectSound, Kernel Streaming, ASIO and AddIn extensions. It is highly extensible and offers high performance with low resource use.\n\n    TTPlayer supports MP3/mp3PRO, AAC/AAC+, M4A/MP4, WMA, APE, MPC, OGG, WAVE, CD, FLAC, RM ,TTA, AIFF, AU as well as MOD, MIDI and CUE files. It can convert all formats to WAVE, MP3, APE, WMA, etc. With COM AddIn, TTPlayer can enable playback and conversion of more types of file.\n\n    TTPlayer supports SSRC, different bit output mode, ReplayGain, 10-band EQ, Dolby Surround and Crossfade. It is compatible with and can activate several Winamp2 plug-ins at the same time.\n\n    TTPlayer supports ID3v1/v2, WMA, RM, APE and Vorbis tagging. You can batch edit tags and rename files with tags.\n\n    TTPlayer can synchronize scrolling lyrics display and supports playback dragging. You can search lyrics online and edit lyrics yourself. \n\n   TTPlayer allows you to search for playlists and audio files. You can enjoy different visual effects and choose your favorite skins (XML/ZIP). TTPlayer also includes functions such as windows snap, half-transparent/fading windows, windows shadow, icon display on taskbar, customizable hotkeys, scrolling info and tooltips on menu.\n\n    TTPlayer is a completely free audio player, without any registration requirement or function and trial use limits."

